WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Start: the window opens on a welcome card with the three steps.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.861
Press “Add scans…” (or the Add button) to pick images, a PDF or an archive.

00:00:08.961 --> 00:00:20.779
The system file dialog opens; here we type the path and confirm.

00:00:20.879 --> 00:00:25.779
The page is processed at once: a crooked double sheet is split, straightened and cropped.

00:00:25.879 --> 00:00:41.824
More files: File ▸ Add images… accepts several at a time.

00:00:41.924 --> 00:01:00.346
File ▸ Add folder… takes every image of a folder.

00:01:00.446 --> 00:01:09.739
The page list: select a page to preview it; Up and Down change the order.

00:01:09.839 --> 00:01:16.678
Remove deletes the selected page from the job; Clear empties the list.

00:01:16.778 --> 00:01:20.604
The list is empty again and the welcome card is back.
